---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Industry Maps｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">

    <div class="kicker">INDUSTRY MAPS · V1.1-10-C</div>

    <h1>產業地圖</h1>

    <p>
      從技術節點出發，重新理解 AI 時代的產業鏈。
      不只看公司，而是看技術如何一路落地。
    </p>

  </div>
</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     MAP NAVIGATION
========================================================= -->

<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">RESEARCH NAVIGATION</div>
      <h2>從 Research 進入產業地圖</h2>
    </div>

    <p>Research → Maps → Evidence</p>

  </div>


  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card navigation-card">

      <span class="tag">RESEARCH</span>

      <h3>AI Platform Evolution</h3>

      <p>
        從台積電技術論壇出發，
        追蹤 AI Platform 從先進製程、
        先進封裝、光互連到基礎設施的演進。
      </p>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/research">
        Read Research →
      </a>

    </article>


    <article class="card navigation-card">

      <span class="tag">POSTERS</span>

      <h3>Research Posters</h3>

      <p>
        將複雜的技術與產業鏈濃縮成
        一頁式視覺化研究，快速掌握核心訊號。
      </p>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/posters">
        Open Posters →
      </a>

    </article>


    <article class="card navigation-card">

      <span class="tag">DOWNLOADS</span>

      <h3>Research Library</h3>

      <p>
        前往研究資料庫，
        閱讀 Research Vol.01 與印刷級 PDF。
      </p>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/downloads">
        Open Downloads →
      </a>

    </article>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     CORE INDUSTRY MAPS
========================================================= -->

<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">

      <div>
        <div class="kicker">CORE INDUSTRY MAPS</div>
        <h2>三張核心產業地圖</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Technology → Supply Chain → Evidence</p>

    </div>


    <div class="grid">


      <!-- AI ECOSYSTEM -->

      <article class="map-card">

        <span class="tag">01 · AI ECOSYSTEM</span>

        <h3>AI 全產業鏈</h3>

        <p class="map-lead">
          從 AI Compute 出發，沿著先進封裝、
          高速互連一路延伸至 AI Server、
          電力與散熱。
        </p>


        <div class="map-flow">

          <span>AI Chip</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>HBM</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Advanced Packaging</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Optical</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>AI Server</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Power</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Cooling</span>

        </div>


        <div class="map-note">

          <strong>RESEARCH FOCUS</strong>

          <p>
            AI GPU / ASIC、HBM、CoWoS、CPO、
            高速 PCB、電力與散熱，
            如何共同形成下一代 AI Infrastructure。
          </p>

        </div>


        <a class="map-link" href="/research">
          回到 Research Vol.01 →
        </a>

      </article>


      <!-- GLASS CORE -->

      <article class="map-card">

        <span class="tag">02 · GLASS CORE</span>

        <h3>Glass Core Ecosystem</h3>

        <p class="map-lead">
          從玻璃材料、TGV，到 Glass Core Substrate，
          最終連結先進封裝與 AI Accelerator。
        </p>


        <div class="map-flow">

          <span>Glass</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>TGV</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Metallization</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Glass Core</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Advanced Packaging</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>AI Accelerator</span>

        </div>


        <div class="map-note">

          <strong>RESEARCH FOCUS</strong>

          <p>
            Glass Material、TGV、金屬化、
            Core Substrate、RDL 與先進封裝之間的技術關係，
            以及全球供應鏈布局。
          </p>

        </div>


        <a class="map-link" href="/posters">
          查看相關研究海報 →
        </a>

      </article>


      <!-- CPO -->

      <article class="map-card">

        <span class="tag">03 · CPO ECOSYSTEM</span>

        <h3>CPO Ecosystem</h3>

        <p class="map-lead">
          AI 資料中心高速互連，
          正從純電互連逐步走向
          Optical + Packaging 的新架構。
        </p>


        <div class="map-flow">

          <span>AI Compute</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Switch</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Optical Engine</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>CPO</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Fiber</span>
          <b>→</b>

          <span>Data Center</span>

        </div>


        <div class="map-note">

          <strong>RESEARCH FOCUS</strong>

          <p>
            Switch、Optical Engine、光纖、
            封裝、散熱與電力，
            如何共同決定 CPO 商業化速度。
          </p>

        </div>


        <a class="map-link" href="/posters">
          查看 CPO Research Poster →
        </a>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     HOW TO READ
========================================================= -->

<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">HOW TO READ THE MAPS</div>
      <h2>不要只看公司，要看技術位置</h2>
    </div>

    <p>Facts First · Evidence-Based Research</p>

  </div>


  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card">

      <span class="tag">01 · TECHNOLOGY</span>

      <h3>技術節點</h3>

      <p>
        先確認一項技術在整個產業鏈中的位置，
        再判斷它解決的是什麼問題。
      </p>

    </article>


    <article class="card">

      <span class="tag">02 · SUPPLY CHAIN</span>

      <h3>供應鏈位置</h3>

      <p>
        從上游材料、設備，
        到中游製程與零組件，
        最後連結終端應用。
      </p>

    </article>


    <article class="card">

      <span class="tag">03 · EVIDENCE</span>

      <h3>證據強度</h3>

      <p>
        已量產、驗證中、開發中與產業推論，
        必須清楚區分，
        避免把推論當成事實。
      </p>

    </article>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     EVIDENCE FRAMEWORK
========================================================= -->

<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">

      <div>
        <div class="kicker">EVIDENCE FRAMEWORK</div>
        <h2>研究狀態分層</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Evidence Level</p>

    </div>


    <div class="grid">

      <article class="card evidence-card">

        <span class="tag">PRODUCTION</span>

        <h3>已量產</h3>

        <p>
          已有公開資訊支持產品或技術
          進入量產階段。
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="card evidence-card">

        <span class="tag">QUALIFICATION</span>

        <h3>驗證／導入</h3>

        <p>
          已進入客戶驗證、導入
          或供應鏈認證階段。
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="card evidence-card">

        <span class="tag">DEVELOPMENT</span>

        <h3>開發中</h3>

        <p>
          技術或產品仍處於開發、
          測試或樣品階段。
        </p>

      </article>

    </div>


    <div class="card inference-card">

      <span class="tag">J INSIGHT · INFERENCE</span>

      <h3>產業推論</h3>

      <p>
        尚未有公司正式公告，
        但依據技術路徑、供應鏈關係
        與公開資訊，可以建立合理的研究假設。
      </p>

      <p class="inference-warning">
        ※ Inference 不等同於已確認事實，
        正式研究中將與公開資訊分開標示。
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     RESEARCH CONNECTION
========================================================= -->

<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">FROM MAP TO RESEARCH</div>
      <h2>產業地圖不是終點</h2>
    </div>

  </div>


  <article class="card research-connection">

    <div class="connection-flow">

      <div>
        <span class="connection-number">01</span>
        <strong>Industry Event</strong>
        <small>產業事件</small>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <span class="connection-number">02</span>
        <strong>Research</strong>
        <small>研究拆解</small>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <span class="connection-number">03</span>
        <strong>Industry Maps</strong>
        <small>產業位置</small>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <span class="connection-number">04</span>
        <strong>Evidence</strong>
        <small>驗證進度</small>
      </div>

      <b>→</b>

      <div>
        <span class="connection-number">05</span>
        <strong>Poster / PDF</strong>
        <small>研究輸出</small>
      </div>

    </div>


    <p class="connection-text">
      每一張產業地圖，都應該能回到研究來源；
      每一項研究，也應該能找到對應的技術節點與供應鏈位置。
    </p>

  </article>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     FINAL NAVIGATION
========================================================= -->

<section class="cta">

  <div class="cta-inner">

    <div>

      <div class="kicker">NEXT STEP</div>

      <h2>從產業地圖，走向真正的研究。</h2>

      <p>
        閱讀 Research Vol.01、
        查看研究海報，
        或進入 Research Library 取得印刷級 PDF。
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="cta-actions">

      <a class="button" href="/research">
        Read Research →
      </a>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/posters">
        View Posters
      </a>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/downloads">
        Downloads
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<style>

  .navigation-card {
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  .navigation-card .button-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }


  .map-card {
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  .map-lead {
    color: #b8c4d1;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }


  .map-flow {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding: 18px;

    border: 1px solid #2b394a;
    border-radius: 12px;

    background: #0b1119;

    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;

    gap: 8px;

    font-size: 13px;
    color: #d9e2ec;
  }


  .map-flow span {
    padding: 5px 8px;

    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 6px;

    background: #121c28;
  }


  .map-flow b {
    color: #7188a0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }


  .map-note {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding-top: 18px;

    border-top: 1px solid #2b394a;
  }


  .map-note strong {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    color: #8fa6bf;
  }


  .map-note p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }


  .map-link {
    display: inline-block;

    margin-top: 20px;

    color: #d9e5f1;

    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;

    border-bottom: 1px solid #52667c;

    padding-bottom: 3px;
  }


  .map-link:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: #ffffff;
  }


  .evidence-card {
    min-height: 180px;
  }


  .inference-card {
    margin-top: 18px;
    border-color: #40536a;
  }


  .inference-warning {
    color: #7f8d9d !important;
    font-size: 12px;
  }


  .research-connection {
    padding: 34px;
  }


  .connection-flow {
    display: flex;

    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;

    gap: 14px;

    overflow-x: auto;
  }


  .connection-flow > div {
    min-width: 130px;

    padding: 18px;

    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 12px;

    background: #101923;

    text-align: center;
  }


  .connection-flow b {
    color: #65788d;
    font-size: 18px;
  }


  .connection-number {
    display: block;

    color: #7f9bb7;

    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;

    letter-spacing: .12em;

    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }


  .connection-flow strong {
    display: block;

    font-size: 14px;
  }


  .connection-flow small {
    display: block;

    color: #7f8d9d;

    margin-top: 3px;

    font-size: 11px;
  }


  .connection-text {
    margin: 28px 0 0;

    color: #aeb9c6;

    text-align: center;
  }


  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;

    flex-wrap: wrap;

    gap: 10px;

    align-items: center;
  }


  .cta-actions .button-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
  }


  @media(max-width:800px) {

    .map-flow {
      line-height: 1.8;
    }


    .map-flow b {
      display: none;
    }


    .connection-flow {
      justify-content: flex-start;

      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }


    .connection-flow b {
      display: none;
    }


    .connection-flow > div {
      min-width: 145px;
    }


    .connection-text {
      text-align: left;
    }


    .cta-actions {
      margin-top: 22px;

      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }


    .cta-actions .button,
    .cta-actions .button-secondary {
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
    }

  }

</style>

</BaseLayout>
